---
// Three ways flat designs create clear depth without blurred drop-shadows:
// 1) Tonal lightness (lighter = closer, darker = recessed)
// 2) Solid 0px-blur offset shadow
// 3) Overlapping elements across boundaries + background-matched cutout borders
const W = 900;
const H = 280;
---
<figure class="dfo">
  <div class="dfo-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three flat-design depth techniques side by side: tonal lightness steps from darker recessed to lighter raised surfaces, a crisp zero-blur solid offset shadow, and overlapping elements crossing a background seam with background-colored rings around stacked avatars.">
      <!-- Panel 1: Tonal lightness -->
      <rect x="20" y="18" width="272" height="236" rx="10" class="dfo-panel" />
      <text x="38" y="44" class="dfo-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Tonal lightness</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Độ sáng bề mặt</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Recessed well -->
      <rect x="44" y="64" width="224" height="148" rx="8" class="dfo-tone-0" />
      <text x="56" y="84" class="dfo-tiny">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Recessed (darker)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Lõm xuống (tối hơn)</tspan>
      </text>
      <!-- Base card -->
      <rect x="64" y="98" width="184" height="98" rx="7" class="dfo-tone-1" />
      <text x="76" y="118" class="dfo-tiny">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Base surface</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Bề mặt chuẩn</tspan>
      </text>
      <!-- Closest highlight card -->
      <rect x="86" y="132" width="140" height="48" rx="6" class="dfo-tone-2" />
      <text x="156" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="dfo-lbl">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Closest (lightest)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Gần nhất (sáng nhất)</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="156" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="dfo-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Essential in dark mode</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cốt lõi khi làm dark mode</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Panel 2: Solid 0px-blur shadow -->
      <rect x="314" y="18" width="272" height="236" rx="10" class="dfo-panel" />
      <text x="332" y="44" class="dfo-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. Solid shadow (0px blur)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Bóng đặc (blur 0px)</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Hard offset shadow -->
      <rect x="366" y="96" width="176" height="84" rx="8" class="dfo-solid-sh" />
      <rect x="360" y="90" width="176" height="84" rx="8" class="dfo-solid-card" />
      <line x1="378" y1="118" x2="466" y2="118" class="dfo-skel-strong" />
      <line x1="378" y1="138" x2="512" y2="138" class="dfo-skel" />
      <line x1="378" y1="154" x2="484" y2="154" class="dfo-skel" />
      <text x="450" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="dfo-code">0 6px 0 0</text>
      <text x="450" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="dfo-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Crisp, playful, zero mud</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Gọn gàng, cá tính, không đục</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Panel 3: Overlap & invisible border -->
      <rect x="608" y="18" width="272" height="236" rx="10" class="dfo-panel" />
      <text x="626" y="44" class="dfo-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>3. Overlap layers</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>3. Xếp chồng vượt biên</tspan>
      </text>

      <!-- Top colored band -->
      <rect x="628" y="62" width="232" height="58" rx="6" class="dfo-band" />
      <!-- Card straddling the band seam -->
      <rect x="652" y="92" width="184" height="62" rx="7" class="dfo-overlap-card" />
      <line x1="670" y1="115" x2="770" y2="115" class="dfo-skel-strong" />
      <line x1="670" y1="133" x2="812" y2="133" class="dfo-skel" />

      <!-- Overlapping avatar stack with background-colored cutout rings -->
      <circle cx="712" cy="188" r="17" class="dfo-av dfo-av-1" />
      <circle cx="738" cy="188" r="17" class="dfo-av dfo-av-2" />
      <circle cx="764" cy="188" r="17" class="dfo-av dfo-av-3" />
      <text x="744" y="236" text-anchor="middle" class="dfo-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Crosses seams + cutout rings</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cắt ngang ranh giới + viền tách</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Blur is optional. Surface lightness, crisp offset silhouettes, and physical overlap all signal which layer sits in front.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Không nhất thiết phải làm mờ. Độ sáng bề mặt, bóng đặc không nhòe và cách xếp chồng vượt biên đều báo rõ lớp nào nằm trên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .dfo { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .dfo-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .dfo svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .dfo text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .dfo-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dfo text.dfo-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .dfo-tone-0 { fill: var(--border); opacity: 0.7; }
  .dfo-tone-1 { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dfo-tone-2 { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dfo text.dfo-tiny { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dfo text.dfo-lbl { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .dfo text.dfo-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dfo-solid-sh { fill: var(--red); opacity: 0.85; }
  .dfo-solid-card { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.75; }
  .dfo-skel-strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 4; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.75; }
  .dfo-skel { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 3; stroke-linecap: round; opacity: 0.45; }
  .dfo text.dfo-code { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--red); }
  .dfo-band { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .dfo-overlap-card { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.25; }
  .dfo-av { stroke: var(--bg-alt); stroke-width: 3.5; }
  .dfo-av-1 { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .dfo-av-2 { fill: var(--gold); }
  .dfo-av-3 { fill: var(--red); }
  .dfo figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
